## Context Providers (wrapping order)

`BrowserRouter` → `AuthProvider` → `LanguageProvider` → `SiteSettingsProvider` → `AppRoutes`

## Routing

| Path | Component | Auth? |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `/` | Home | No |
| `/about` | About | No |
| `/events` | Events | No |
| `/events/:id` | EventDetail | No |
| `/sermons` | Sermons | No |
| `/sermons/:id` | SermonDetail | No |
| `/contact` | Contact | No |
| `/give` | Give | No |
| `/login` | Login (no Layout) | No |
| `/register` | Register (no Layout) | No |
| `/profile-update` | ProfileUpdate | Yes (ProtectedRoute) |
| `/admin` | AdminDashboard (AdminLayout) | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/church-info` | AdminChurchInfo | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/events` | AdminEvents | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/sermons` | AdminSermons | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/giving` | AdminGiving | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/youth` | AdminYouth | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/media` | AdminMedia | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/messages` | AdminMessages | Yes (admin) |
| `*` | NotFound (404) | No |

Login and Register render **outside** the Layout (no Navbar/Footer).
Admin routes use `AdminLayout` (sidebar + `<Routes>`) inside the main Layout.

## Public navigation (Navbar)

- **Surface:** Light bar (`bg-navbar/90` with `backdrop-blur`); nav links and brand use primary/muted text; Sign In uses solid primary button.
- **Desktop:** `Home`, `About`, then Radix **DropdownMenu** groups **Ministries** (Youth & Children) and **Media** (Sermons, Events) via `NavDropdown`, then top-level **Contact** and a prominent **Give** link, then optional **Complete Profile** / **Admin** when applicable; language is a pill toggle (EN / አማ).
- **≤1024px:** Primary nav collapses to a hamburger; the panel is a Radix **Sheet** drawer that groups links under Main / Ministries / Media / Connect / Account. Body scroll lock is handled by `useScrollLock`.
- Navigation arrays live in `src/constants/nav.js` (`PRIMARY_NAV`, `MINISTRIES_NAV`, `MEDIA_NAV`, `CONNECT_NAV`, `ADMIN_NAV`) so desktop and mobile menus never drift.
- **Typography:** Google Fonts in `index.html` — **Cormorant Garamond** (`font-display`) for brand/nav display; **Fraunces** + **Noto Serif Ethiopic** (`font-hero`) for home hero titles, page hero `h1`, section titles, and CTA banner headlines (Ethiopic covers Amharic). **DM Sans** (`font-sans`) for UI.

