| `users` | Own profile only | Owner creates; owner or admin updates |
| `events` | Yes | Admin only |
| `sermons` | Yes | Admin only |
| `contactMessages` | No | Anyone creates; admin manages |
| `prayerRequests` | No | Anyone creates; admin manages |
| `churchProfileUpdates` | No | Auth users create; admin manages |
| `siteSettings` | Yes | Admin only |
| `youthVideos` | Yes | Admin only |
| `youthPageContent` | Yes | Admin only |
| `userMinistries` | Owner or super-admin | Super-admin only |
| `userIndex` | Super-admin only | Super-admin (registration creates own row) |
| `ministries` | Yes | Admin only |

## Bilingual Data Model

All user-visible Firebase content has bilingual (EN/AM) field pairs:
- **Events**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm`, `details`/`detailsAm`, `location`/`locationAm`
- **Sermons**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm`
- **churchInfo.serviceTimes[]**: `day`/`dayAm`, `note`/`noteAm`
- **churchInfo.beliefs[]**: `title`/`titleAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **churchInfo.values[]**: `icon` (Heroicons key from `src/utils/valueIcons.js`; legacy emoji strings still map until admin save), `title`/`titleAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **churchInfo**: `missionStatement`/`missionStatementAm`, `storyPara1`/`storyPara1Am`, `storyPara2`/`storyPara2Am`, optional `pastorName`/`pastorNameAm` (Home pastoral contact card)
- **givingSettings.funds[]**: `label`/`labelAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **givingSettings**: `scriptureText`/`scriptureTextAm`, `scriptureCite`/`scriptureCiteAm`, `plannedGivingText`/`plannedGivingTextAm`
- **youthPageContent/main**: bilingual `*En` / `*Am` string fields for hero, intro, stats, ministry cards, section titles, CTA, empty video copy; `faqs[]` with `questionEn`/`questionAm`, `answerEn`/`answerAm`
- **youthVideos**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm` (plus `url`, metadata, `thumbnailUrl`, `sortOrder`)

Rendering pattern: `const { pickLocalized } = useLanguage(); const display = pickLocalized(item, 'title');` — falls back to English when the Amharic value is empty.

## User Roles

- `member` — default role on registration, stored in `users/{uid}.role`
- `admin` — can write events/sermons, manage all collections, access admin panel

## Environment Variables

All prefixed with `VITE_FIREBASE_` and accessed via `import.meta.env`:
- `VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID`

Optional: `VITE_CLIENT_INTAKE_FORM_URL` (was used on Contact page; now removed from UI).

Optional: `VITE_HERO_YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID` — 11-character YouTube video ID for the Home page hero background video (embed via `youtube-nocookie.com`). If unset, a built-in default scenic B-roll is used; override per environment or edit `DEFAULT_HERO_YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID` in `src/pages/Home.jsx`.

